<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia C/A deficit jumps to $94.6 mln in Nov.</title>
<headline>Slovenia C/A deficit jumps to $94.6 mln in Nov.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Slovenia reported the following economic indicator details on Friday.</p>
<p>CURRENT ACCOUNT BALANCE</p>
<p>    (in millions of dollars)     Nov	Oct	Nov 95</p>
<p> Current account balance	   -94.6     32.6     -21.7</p>
<p> Merchandise trade balance	-192	-82	-124</p>
<p> Exports				 634	741	 729</p>
<p> Imports				 826	823	 853</p>
<p>-- Marja Novak, Ljubljana Newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
